"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThis is a representative short story by the author Edgar Allan Poe, whose name I have heard many times.  \nThe first feeling I got from encountering the author's work was horror and darkness.  \nIn fact, after reading only the  part and feeling that it wasn't exactly my style, I read the rest of the short stories as well.  \n\nIndeed, it's not my style. But it has charm.  \nI plan to challenge it again much later, in the distant future.\n"